  "strings": {
    "Deal. Show me what your dragons can do.": "说定了。让我看看你的龙有多厉害。",
    "Face Teana's fairies in an optional village duel.": "在村庄的额外决斗中挑战缇安娜的天使族卡组。",
    "Festival of Light": "光之庆典",
    "My turn. A quiet deck can still surprise you.": "轮到我了。安静的卡组也会带来惊喜。",
    "One More Duel": "再来一场",
    "One more round before the lanterns go out?": "灯笼熄灭前，再来一局如何？",
    "Return to Jono's table for a friendly rematch.": "回到乔诺的桌前，来一场友好的再战。",
    "Then let the lanterns be our audience.": "那就让灯笼为我们观战吧。",
    "Well played. Next time, I will have another surprise ready.": "打得不错。下次，我会准备另一个惊喜。",
    "You win tonight. But keep a seat for me at the next festival!": "今晚你赢了。不过，下次庆典别忘了给我留个座位！",
